    "summary": "Stock & Warehouse Inventory Management System \u2014 Next.js, TypeScript, Prisma, MongoDB Full-Stack (including AI Business Insights + Admin Panel + Client & Supplier Role-Based Dashboards & more) An open-source, role-based warehouse and stock inventory platform. Store owners (admin), suppliers, and clients manage products, multi-warehouse stock, orders, invoices, shipping, payments, support tickets, and analytics \u2014 with SSR-first Next.js pages, TanStack Query for instant UI updates after CRUD, and optional Stripe / Shippo / Brevo / Redis / Sentry / AI integr"
